---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Android Jarvis Assistant - Full Product Blueprint" description="Production-ready blueprint for building an Android Jarvis assistant with integrations, orchestration, security, and rollout plan.">
  <Navbar />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-b border-border">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-muted mb-3">Product Blueprint</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text mb-6">Android “Jarvis” Assistant — Full Application Plan</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted max-w-4xl">A complete execution-ready architecture based on your research: integrations, Android capabilities, voice stack, multi-model orchestration, memory design, security, and phased delivery.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 space-y-10">
      <div class="p-6 border border-border rounded-xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Core Capabilities</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-muted space-y-2">
          <li>Unified inbox + assistant for Gmail/Outlook, Calendar, Contacts, and Drive.</li>
          <li>Phone actions: call, SMS, notification summarization, reminders and scheduled jobs.</li>
          <li>Voice-first UX: push-to-talk, streaming STT, actionable confirmations, natural TTS.</li>
          <li>LLM routing across multiple providers with failover, budgets, and quality policies.</li>
          <li>Memory layer with private local storage and optional cloud vector retrieval.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 border border-border rounded-xl overflow-x-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">System Architecture</h2>
        <pre class="text-sm text-muted"><code>{`flowchart LR
  A[Android App] --> B[Auth Manager\nGoogle + Microsoft OAuth]
  A --> C[Voice Layer\nSTT + TTS]
  A --> D[Action Engine\nCalls/SMS/Notifications/Reminders]
  A --> E[Conversation UI]

  B --> F[Provider APIs\nGmail/Calendar/People/Drive/Graph]
  E --> G[Backend Orchestrator]
  C --> G
  D --> G

  G --> H[Model Router\nOpenAI/Claude/Gemini/Kimi]
  G --> I[Memory Service\nEmbeddings + Vector DB]
  G --> J[Policy & Audit Layer]

  I --> K[(Local Encrypted DB)]
  I --> L[(Cloud Vector Store)]

  J --> M[Observability\nLogs/Metrics/Tracing]
  J --> N[Quota + Rate Limits + Abuse Controls]`}</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 border border-border rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Integrations</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-muted space-y-2">
            <li>Gmail: list/read/send with minimal scopes.</li>
            <li>Calendar: list/create/update events + reminders.</li>
            <li>People/Contacts: contact resolution for calls/messages.</li>
            <li>Drive: retrieval for assistant context and attachments.</li>
            <li>Microsoft Graph parity for Outlook ecosystem users.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 border border-border rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Android OS Features</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-muted space-y-2">
            <li>NotificationListenerService for inbox-style summarization.</li>
            <li>ACTION_DIAL/ACTION_CALL flows with explicit confirmations.</li>
            <li>SEND_SMS handling and fallback composer UI.</li>
            <li>AlarmManager for exact reminders; WorkManager for sync.</li>
            <li>Runtime permissions with contextual explanations.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 border border-border rounded-xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Phased Delivery Timeline</h2>
        <pre class="text-sm text-muted"><code>{`gantt
  title Android Jarvis Build Plan
  dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
  section Foundation
  Auth + secure token storage           :a1, 2026-05-20, 14d
  Basic chat + provider setup           :a2, after a1, 10d

  section Integrations
  Gmail + Calendar + Contacts           :b1, after a2, 18d
  Graph (Outlook) parity                :b2, after b1, 12d

  section Intelligence
  Multi-model router + fallback         :c1, after b1, 14d
  Memory + embeddings + retrieval       :c2, after c1, 12d

  section Voice + Actions
  STT/TTS pipeline + barge-in UX        :d1, after c1, 12d
  Calls/SMS/Notifications/Reminders     :d2, after d1, 12d

  section Hardening
  Security/privacy review + pentest     :e1, after d2, 10d
  Beta diagnostics + observability      :e2, after e1, 10d`}</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 border border-border rounded-xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Non-Negotiable Product Rules</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-muted space-y-2">
          <li>High-risk actions require explicit user confirmation + payload preview.</li>
          <li>Never ship provider secrets in the APK; keep them server-side only.</li>
          <li>Default to least-privilege OAuth scopes and just-in-time permissions.</li>
          <li>All failures must return user-readable fallback messaging and retry options.</li>
          <li>Every provider/API call must be observable with trace IDs and error taxonomy.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
